                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Not from here. Not one of us.\n@Live5News featured Kevin de L\u2019Aigle in their protest coverage from the town hall last night\u2014but failed to mention he\u2019s not even from South Carolina.\n\nHe\u2019s a New York transplant who ran for office in Georgia and dropped out. Now he\u2019s showing up in Beaufort County pretending to speak for our constituents? Give me a break.\n\nLet\u2019s be clear:\nHe\u2019s not a voter here.\nHe\u2019s not a constituent.\n\nThe media didn\u2019t do their homework. But South Carolinians see through the noise.\n\nWe won\u2019t be bullied. We won\u2019t be silenced. And we won\u2019t let outsiders hijack our district.",
